WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.770 --> 01:31.180
[My Journey to You]

01:31.200 --> 01:34.050
[Episode 9]

01:40.289 --> 01:40.800
Father!

01:41.320 --> 01:42.450
I don't want to go in.

01:44.100 --> 01:45.100
It's cold inside.

01:46.539 --> 01:47.229
No.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.390
Young Master.

02:00.300 --> 02:00.860
Yun.

02:02.310 --> 02:03.310
Did I fall asleep?

02:05.740 --> 02:07.200
You fainted from the cold.

02:08.490 --> 02:10.820
I told you not to act tough or be impatient,

02:11.240 --> 02:13.040
but you still acted recklessly.

02:13.700 --> 02:14.860
If I hadn't come,

02:15.650 --> 02:16.450
you might have

02:17.079 --> 02:19.079
frozen to death in that ice bucket.

02:29.160 --> 02:30.560
Why are your hands so hot?

02:34.940 --> 02:36.030
I've had a nickname

02:36.290 --> 02:37.350
since I was little,

02:38.200 --> 02:39.530
called Little Furnace.

02:39.790 --> 02:41.120
Why would a girl like you

02:41.390 --> 02:42.920
have such a nickname?

02:44.230 --> 02:45.340
My family said

02:45.910 --> 02:47.760
that my mother had reached the full term

02:47.760 --> 02:48.850
of pregnancy with me,

02:48.850 --> 02:50.510
but there was no sign of birth.

02:51.180 --> 02:53.310
I wasn't born until a dozen days later.

02:54.670 --> 02:55.820
They teased

02:55.930 --> 02:57.480
that I was well-cooked.

02:57.970 --> 02:59.020
What a coincidence.

02:59.020 --> 03:00.090
I had a premature birth,

03:00.090 --> 03:01.430
so I tend to be cold.

03:02.670 --> 03:03.750
With the two of us,

03:04.230 --> 03:05.150
one is like ice

03:06.220 --> 03:07.680
and the other is like fire.

03:08.280 --> 03:09.610
We are a match made in...

03:14.190 --> 03:15.090
Made in...

03:24.670 --> 03:25.180
Yun,

03:26.060 --> 03:26.980
you just said

03:27.740 --> 03:30.200
it was you who pulled me out of the ice bucket.

03:31.630 --> 03:33.360
I couldn't carry you by myself,

03:33.470 --> 03:35.240
so I asked some servants

03:35.550 --> 03:36.790
to help lift you out.

03:40.790 --> 03:41.850
Young Master Ziyu.

03:46.210 --> 03:47.340
You saw everything?

03:54.860 --> 03:55.600
Yes.

04:02.260 --> 04:03.640
I only saw your chest.

04:05.350 --> 04:06.690
You're a man.

04:07.110 --> 04:08.180
This is nothing.

04:09.130 --> 04:10.050
Besides,

04:12.010 --> 04:13.770
I'm already married to you.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.779
We're not married yet.

04:21.339 --> 04:22.600
Won't you ask me

04:23.290 --> 04:25.820
why I came to see you in the middle of the night?

04:29.550 --> 04:30.910
How would I know?

04:34.840 --> 04:35.640
Young Master,

04:35.920 --> 04:37.180
what are you thinking?

04:39.130 --> 04:40.980
You asked me

04:41.170 --> 04:42.620
why you came to me.

04:44.510 --> 04:45.450
What?

04:48.790 --> 04:50.100
I came to tell you

04:50.710 --> 04:52.320
I seem to have found

04:52.430 --> 04:54.159
the way to pass the first trial.

04:55.159 --> 04:55.850
Really?

04:59.220 --> 05:02.090
There are hundreds of mental techniques in the world,

05:02.090 --> 05:03.460
but they can be roughly divided into

05:03.460 --> 05:05.270
metal, wood, water, fire, and earth.

05:03.840 --> 05:06.360
[Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, Earth]

05:05.410 --> 05:06.410
These five types.

05:06.670 --> 05:07.750
These five types

05:07.750 --> 05:10.010
can be further divided into yin and yang.

05:10.790 --> 05:12.200
Among them, metal and fire techniques

05:12.200 --> 05:14.060
are the Supreme Yang techniques,

05:14.340 --> 05:16.610
such as the Yang-Splitting Chant of the Kunlun Sect

05:16.610 --> 05:19.070
and the Metal Language of the Cangshan Sect.

05:19.590 --> 05:22.180
Water and wood techniques are the Supreme Yin techniques,

05:22.180 --> 05:22.910
such as

05:22.920 --> 05:25.020
the Brocade Heart Sutra of the Qingfeng Sect,

05:25.020 --> 05:27.240
and the Water Avoidance Art of the Blackwater Sect.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.970
Furthermore, the Yijin Manual

05:29.360 --> 05:30.690
has an earth attribute.

05:31.630 --> 05:32.750
It includes both yin and yang,

05:32.750 --> 05:33.780
integrating all.

05:34.510 --> 05:36.260
If the Gong residence's mental techniques

05:36.260 --> 05:37.659
are under metal and fire,

05:38.100 --> 05:40.560
then the Ice Pool can naturally be overcome.

05:41.510 --> 05:42.270
This coincides

05:42.270 --> 05:43.710
with what Jin Fan said.

05:44.560 --> 05:45.420
The first trial

05:45.940 --> 05:47.330
seems to ask you

05:47.370 --> 05:50.540
to find the Snow Saber Scripture at the bottom of the Ice Pool,

05:50.540 --> 05:51.740
but actually,

05:52.710 --> 05:54.640
it is testing your internal skill.

05:58.130 --> 05:59.050
But

05:59.580 --> 06:01.030
the Gong residence

06:01.590 --> 06:03.780
has multiple kinds of mental techniques.

06:03.780 --> 06:04.980
We have so many kinds.

06:06.700 --> 06:07.790
The Gong residence

06:07.790 --> 06:10.270
has created three unique mental techniques.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.240
In addition,

06:11.590 --> 06:13.590
my ancestors had fought in the martial world for years

06:13.590 --> 06:15.850
and learned many top mental techniques.

06:16.550 --> 06:17.430
Even

06:17.640 --> 06:19.370
some long-lost mental techniques

06:19.370 --> 06:21.220
from major martial sects

06:21.390 --> 06:23.890
are also recorded within the Gong residence.

06:23.890 --> 06:26.090
It's just that we are not allowed to cultivate them.

06:26.090 --> 06:27.040
Then,

06:27.200 --> 06:28.730
which one do you cultivate?

06:32.200 --> 06:33.460
Snowmelt Heart Sutra.

06:35.860 --> 06:37.500
I've never heard of it.

06:39.490 --> 06:41.620
It's a unique method created by the Gong residence.

06:41.620 --> 06:42.950
Few people cultivate it

06:43.210 --> 06:45.010
even within the Gong residence.

06:47.630 --> 06:48.420
Father,

06:48.420 --> 06:49.690
it's too cold.

06:50.340 --> 06:51.740
I can't stand it anymore.

06:51.950 --> 06:54.409
If you don't want to be frozen, use the chant.

06:54.430 --> 06:56.240
I've memorized it long ago,

06:56.490 --> 06:58.930
but it's too cold. I can't recite it.

06:59.310 --> 07:00.240
You're too weak.

07:00.610 --> 07:02.270
You don't deserve to be my son.

07:04.330 --> 07:05.660
Look at how your brother

07:05.670 --> 07:07.070
practices martial arts.

07:19.290 --> 07:20.740
Cold air...

07:21.070 --> 07:22.600
Cold air enters the clouds.

07:23.240 --> 07:25.900
The reception and delivery must be controlled.

07:26.350 --> 07:27.810
You're not allowed to cry.

07:30.130 --> 07:30.800
Continue.

07:31.160 --> 07:32.570
Gather in the core.

07:34.409 --> 07:35.020
Snow...

07:35.470 --> 07:37.400
Snow falls, but the heart does not.

07:38.909 --> 07:40.770
Both enter the Fengmen acupoint.

07:41.430 --> 07:43.090
The pulse nears the end point.

07:44.940 --> 07:45.740
That's great.

07:48.140 --> 07:49.000
It's not great.

07:50.050 --> 07:51.100
My internal skill

07:51.100 --> 07:52.150
can't even hold up

07:52.150 --> 07:53.550
against the winter wind,

07:53.640 --> 07:56.040
let alone dive to the bottom of the Ice Pool.

07:58.790 --> 08:00.390
After my mother passed away,

08:00.800 --> 08:01.710
my father

08:01.900 --> 08:03.760
became stricter and colder to me.

08:05.740 --> 08:07.600
I was born with cold intolerance,

08:07.900 --> 08:09.270
but my father forced me

08:09.270 --> 08:11.330
to practice in frigid environments.

08:12.060 --> 08:12.860
So,

08:13.140 --> 08:14.900
I always resisted

08:15.340 --> 08:17.470
cultivating the Snowmelt Heart Sutra

08:18.660 --> 08:20.260
and gave up later.

08:26.270 --> 08:27.530
The ginger tea is cold.

08:27.630 --> 08:28.890
I'll heat it up for you.

08:30.150 --> 08:30.750
It's okay.

08:31.420 --> 08:33.350
I'm not afraid of this kind of cold.

08:42.190 --> 08:43.700
Young Master, do you think

08:44.169 --> 08:45.340
that the former Sword Wielder

08:45.340 --> 08:46.790
was too heartless to you?

08:51.520 --> 08:53.200
Do you remember what I told you

08:53.770 --> 08:55.620
about my father's shipwreck?

08:57.110 --> 08:58.310
Of course I remember.

08:59.060 --> 09:00.830
I misunderstood you at that time.

09:00.830 --> 09:02.590
I thought you set the river lantern

09:02.590 --> 09:04.170
to send some news out.

09:05.870 --> 09:07.470
After my father passed away,

09:07.990 --> 09:10.720
my mother supported the whole family by herself.

09:11.940 --> 09:12.870
After that,

09:13.690 --> 09:15.720
my mother, who once doted on me,

09:16.400 --> 09:18.160
gradually became strict.

09:20.660 --> 09:22.590
Is that similar to your situation?

09:25.560 --> 09:26.750
When I was young,

09:27.600 --> 09:30.330
I used to ride horses with my godmother, Zhuo Mei,

09:30.700 --> 09:31.820
and practice swordsmanship

09:31.820 --> 09:32.820
and martial arts.

09:33.420 --> 09:34.890
I was as free as a boy.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.260
But after my father's death,

09:39.400 --> 09:42.660
my mother started forcing me to the learn women's virtues.

09:43.270 --> 09:45.470
Every day, I had to practice needlework,

09:45.470 --> 09:48.270
instruments, chess, calligraphy, and painting.

09:50.710 --> 09:51.520
Mother said

09:52.790 --> 09:55.310
that Zhuo Mei had extraordinary swordsmanship,

09:55.310 --> 09:57.040
but she lived a miserable life.

09:58.140 --> 10:00.390
If I can't protect myself by learning martial arts,

10:00.390 --> 10:02.520
it's better to marry into a good family

10:03.310 --> 10:04.770
and protect my whole clan.

10:08.060 --> 10:09.640
Mother told me every day

10:11.110 --> 10:12.430
that a woman

10:13.310 --> 10:14.700
can't live on her own.

10:17.790 --> 10:18.520
Later,

10:20.040 --> 10:21.400
I gradually gave up

10:23.020 --> 10:24.240
and accepted myself

10:24.910 --> 10:27.710
as a tool for my mother to climb up the social ranks.

10:29.380 --> 10:30.480
But in my heart,

10:32.050 --> 10:34.070
a voice continued to tell me

10:35.730 --> 10:36.740
that a person

10:37.600 --> 10:38.730
only lives once.

10:40.750 --> 10:42.850
I should live the way I like.

10:44.990 --> 10:46.020
A skylark

10:47.390 --> 10:49.470
should call out in the valley,

10:51.360 --> 10:52.420
listen to the rain,

10:53.820 --> 10:55.620
and smell the fragrant flowers,

10:57.260 --> 10:59.620
instead of singing in a cage.

11:03.650 --> 11:04.260
So,

11:05.310 --> 11:06.510
I told my mother

11:09.910 --> 11:11.610
I just want to live for myself.

11:13.900 --> 11:16.150
I don't want to be anyone's accessory.

11:19.510 --> 11:21.240
What right do you have to say no?

11:22.030 --> 11:23.690
Since I have no right to say no,

11:24.220 --> 11:25.670
then why am I practicing this?

11:25.670 --> 11:27.000
You are practicing this

11:27.790 --> 11:29.310
so that one day,

11:30.290 --> 11:31.720
you can say no to others.

11:37.730 --> 11:38.510
That's why

11:39.910 --> 11:42.770
you kept wanting to escape from the Gong residence.

11:48.630 --> 11:50.250
But later, I realized

11:51.740 --> 11:53.570
that my mother was just worried that our family

11:53.570 --> 11:54.700
only has women left.

11:56.390 --> 11:57.730
We no longer have someone

11:57.730 --> 11:59.080
who can support us.

12:01.160 --> 12:03.320
She was afraid that I'd be mistreated in the future.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.850
You owe your life to Wufeng.

12:06.340 --> 12:08.360
You also owe your skills to Wufeng.

12:10.400 --> 12:11.730
As long as you're alive,

12:12.380 --> 12:13.980
you must be useful to Wufeng.

12:14.580 --> 12:15.340
Even if you die,

12:15.340 --> 12:17.270
you must still be useful to Wufeng.

12:21.390 --> 12:23.450
I can't live the way I want,

12:25.550 --> 12:26.450
but at the very least,

12:26.450 --> 12:28.150
I can die as I wish.

12:30.270 --> 12:31.030
You can,

12:33.030 --> 12:33.960
but you dare not.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.400
Why not?

12:37.900 --> 12:39.630
Because you still have Yun Que.

12:41.790 --> 12:42.520
As long as

12:43.950 --> 12:46.150
there is someone you love in this world,

12:46.730 --> 12:47.930
you won't dare to die.

12:52.270 --> 12:54.330
If you don't want to have weaknesses,

12:55.230 --> 12:56.810
you must not love anyone.

12:59.790 --> 13:00.920
In my mother's eyes,

13:01.980 --> 13:04.510
the martial arts world filled with conflicts

13:04.900 --> 13:06.310
is too difficult

13:07.630 --> 13:08.600
for a woman.

13:10.800 --> 13:11.750
So, to her,

13:13.180 --> 13:15.580
the Gong family was what could be relied on.

13:15.930 --> 13:17.290
There is a mission now.

13:18.450 --> 13:19.580
You can leave Wufeng

13:22.070 --> 13:23.390
once you complete it

13:24.540 --> 13:26.140
and get the freedom you want.

13:26.770 --> 13:28.770
Actually, the care given by parents

13:29.670 --> 13:31.880
is like the delicate rain on a spring night,

13:31.880 --> 13:33.480
replenishing soundlessly.

13:34.710 --> 13:35.930
My strict mother

13:36.500 --> 13:38.100
watched me suffer every day,

13:38.430 --> 13:39.840
but she tried her best

13:40.380 --> 13:42.780
to bring me new gimmicks from the outside world

13:42.780 --> 13:43.680
to cheer me up.

13:44.730 --> 13:45.990
Give it to your sister.

13:50.680 --> 13:52.280
But she never said anything.

13:59.900 --> 14:01.700
Our parents forced us to grow up,

14:02.950 --> 14:05.150
but it's not their original intention.

14:06.650 --> 14:08.010
They just hope

14:08.850 --> 14:10.380
that before they pass away,

14:11.820 --> 14:13.870
we can learn more

14:15.810 --> 14:16.980
and be able to

14:18.060 --> 14:19.720
safely survive in this world.

14:22.510 --> 14:24.170
More than anything,

14:25.180 --> 14:27.240
they wish we can be children forever.

14:30.300 --> 14:31.760
You're not young anymore.

14:31.770 --> 14:33.300
You'd better think it over.

14:33.710 --> 14:34.510
If

14:34.590 --> 14:36.650
you want to continue being useless,

14:37.320 --> 14:40.520
there's no need for you to stay in the Gong family anymore.

14:45.700 --> 14:47.560
Did I overstep boundaries again?

14:49.460 --> 14:50.120
No.

14:51.460 --> 14:52.780
I like to hear you talk about

14:52.780 --> 14:53.860
your past life.

14:55.470 --> 14:56.800
I also like to hear about

14:56.900 --> 14:57.960
the outside world.

15:02.890 --> 15:03.790
Young Master,

15:05.220 --> 15:06.820
have you never been outside?

15:09.630 --> 15:10.120
Never.

15:13.270 --> 15:14.870
If we have time in the future,

15:15.790 --> 15:17.650
I will accompany you out to see it.

15:21.230 --> 15:21.720
Okay.

15:28.960 --> 15:29.870
But

15:30.030 --> 15:30.810
my back...

15:33.290 --> 15:35.060
After the secret text is tattooed,

15:35.060 --> 15:38.020
you will never be able to leave the Jiuchen Valley.

15:39.150 --> 15:42.030
You must live here for the rest of your life.

15:44.850 --> 15:45.480
What?

15:49.760 --> 15:52.410
Now that I carry the weight of Sword Wielder on my back,

15:52.410 --> 15:54.140
I might not be as free as before.

16:05.310 --> 16:06.070
I got it.

16:08.460 --> 16:09.640
Earlier, you said

16:10.650 --> 16:13.020
the former Sword Wielder always had you practice

16:13.020 --> 16:15.750
the Snowmelt Heart Sutra in frigid environments.

16:15.750 --> 16:16.470
I wonder

16:17.410 --> 16:18.780
if he wanted to

16:18.860 --> 16:20.390
make things easier for you?

16:24.030 --> 16:25.250
I don't dare to speculate

16:25.250 --> 16:27.110
the former Sword Wielder's mind,

16:27.540 --> 16:29.800
But I did hear from my godmother, Zhuo Mei

16:30.380 --> 16:31.910
that Supreme Yang techniques

16:31.910 --> 16:34.350
should be practiced in extremely cold places,

16:34.350 --> 16:35.750
while Supreme Yin forces

16:36.410 --> 16:38.410
should be gained in burning places.

16:39.890 --> 16:41.690
I've never heard of this before.

16:43.150 --> 16:45.020
I didn't understand at that time either,

16:45.020 --> 16:47.020
but my godmother explained it to me.

16:47.390 --> 16:49.640
She said that ordinary people who don't know martial arts

16:49.640 --> 16:51.100
can't help but run and jump

16:51.380 --> 16:53.020
when faced with extreme cold

16:53.340 --> 16:55.750
to warm up their body against the cold.

16:55.940 --> 16:57.670
Those who have internal skills

16:58.130 --> 17:00.820
unconsciously activate their internal skill

17:01.240 --> 17:02.300
to resist the cold.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.680
As time passes,

17:04.619 --> 17:06.470
your internal skill will increase vastly.

17:06.470 --> 17:07.730
You mean,

17:10.290 --> 17:12.670
I accidentally got the way to pass the Ice Pool trial

17:12.670 --> 17:14.710
by soaking in ice water?

17:15.480 --> 17:16.530
Young Master,

17:16.550 --> 17:18.480
you will depart again in a few days.

17:19.140 --> 17:21.180
I'm afriad the cold from the ice water alone

17:21.180 --> 17:22.480
is far from enough.

17:24.220 --> 17:24.810
Then,

17:25.170 --> 17:25.900
how about I sleep

17:25.900 --> 17:28.359
in the lake of Xue Lineage's garden tonight?

17:30.380 --> 17:32.640
I just wanted to liven up the atmosphere.

17:33.930 --> 17:35.910
Ice water is only an external cold.

17:36.430 --> 17:37.490
It's superficial.

17:38.470 --> 17:39.440
It won't improve

17:39.850 --> 17:42.650
your internal skills significantly in a few days.

17:43.260 --> 17:44.520
External cold.

17:45.990 --> 17:47.190
Then what should I do?

17:47.400 --> 17:49.200
Should I chew ice and swallow it?

17:57.900 --> 17:59.120
Miss Yun, are you hot?

18:00.070 --> 18:01.560
My room is full of ice.

18:01.750 --> 18:02.950
You shouldn't be hot.

18:03.030 --> 18:03.620
I'm okay.

18:08.700 --> 18:09.670
Ice and snow

18:10.910 --> 18:12.440
are indeed external colds.

18:14.230 --> 18:16.430
But what about poison inside your body?

18:16.940 --> 18:18.560
Ingesting Supreme Yang poison

18:18.560 --> 18:20.690
can make one feel like they're in hell,

18:21.100 --> 18:22.460
suffering scathing pain.

18:22.460 --> 18:23.790
Meanwhile, Supreme Yin poison

18:23.790 --> 18:24.800
will make one feel

18:25.070 --> 18:26.470
bone-gnawing coldness.

18:27.780 --> 18:29.520
Young Master's extremely cold physique

18:29.520 --> 18:30.490
is rare.

18:31.030 --> 18:32.830
If you take Supreme Cold poison,

18:33.180 --> 18:34.650
no matter what you're doing,

18:34.650 --> 18:35.710
no matter the time,

18:36.670 --> 18:38.720
your body will be constantly activating your internal skill

18:38.720 --> 18:40.180
to resist the cold poison.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.650
In this way,

18:43.220 --> 18:44.150
your skills will

18:44.210 --> 18:46.670
definitely increase vastly in a short time.

18:51.370 --> 18:52.170
What's wrong?

18:52.820 --> 18:53.640
Did I

18:54.290 --> 18:55.490
say something wrong?

18:56.310 --> 18:57.530
You're right.

18:59.270 --> 19:00.390
There are

19:00.890 --> 19:03.580
a handful of Supreme Cold poisons in the Gong residence,

19:03.580 --> 19:04.360
but...

19:04.670 --> 19:05.510
But what?

19:07.650 --> 19:09.550
I've been taking Herb Elixir for a long time.

19:09.550 --> 19:11.080
The poison won't work on me.

19:11.750 --> 19:13.100
Then what if you stop taking it for now

19:13.100 --> 19:15.300
and continue after passing this trial?

19:21.900 --> 19:22.530
I'm sorry.

19:23.310 --> 19:24.510
I was inconsiderate.

19:26.900 --> 19:27.490
Yun,

19:28.500 --> 19:29.550
the Gong residence...

19:29.550 --> 19:32.130
Something just happened to the Gong residence.

19:32.130 --> 19:33.990
Elder Yue was just assassinated,

19:34.780 --> 19:36.270
while the former Sword Wielder and Young Lord

19:36.270 --> 19:37.450
died of poisoning,

19:38.540 --> 19:40.090
yet I suggested that you  stop taking the Herb Elixir

19:40.090 --> 19:41.900
at a time like this.

19:43.620 --> 19:44.460
I am a fool.

19:44.460 --> 19:45.890
Yun, don't say that.

19:47.220 --> 19:48.270
What I meant was

19:49.400 --> 19:51.230
all of the Gong residence's poisons and antidotes

19:51.230 --> 19:53.760
are managed and distributed by Gong Yuanzhi.

19:53.940 --> 19:56.670
The reception, usage, depletion, and surpluses

19:56.860 --> 19:58.390
are all strictly recorded.

19:58.730 --> 20:00.460
He definitely will not allow me

20:01.000 --> 20:03.400
to take a Supreme Cold poison for no reason.

20:10.870 --> 20:12.130
What do you want to say?

20:12.510 --> 20:13.000
Say it.

20:17.550 --> 20:18.390
I trust you.

20:19.440 --> 20:21.170
You can tell me anything.

20:24.260 --> 20:25.590
My godmother, Zhuo Mei,

20:26.400 --> 20:27.870
had been too impatient

20:28.650 --> 20:30.450
when practicing these past few years,

20:30.450 --> 20:31.740
which led to rage.

20:32.660 --> 20:33.250
So,

20:33.860 --> 20:36.210
she produces a kind of cold poison

20:37.540 --> 20:39.740
to suppress the fiery rage in her body.

20:40.620 --> 20:43.080
She said it is attacking poison with poison.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.450
Then,

20:45.850 --> 20:48.050
do you know how to make such cold poison?

20:49.220 --> 20:50.020
Young Master.

20:51.530 --> 20:52.680
Just tell me

20:52.750 --> 20:54.480
if you know how to make it or not.

20:55.250 --> 20:56.530
Choosing to trust you

20:57.070 --> 20:58.170
is my own decision.

20:58.610 --> 20:59.940
You don't need to worry.

21:02.790 --> 21:03.210
I can.

21:06.720 --> 21:07.140
Come.

21:07.790 --> 21:09.580
Let's go to the clinic together.

21:09.580 --> 21:10.520
Absolutely not.

21:11.570 --> 21:12.500
If you go,

21:13.060 --> 21:14.920
I won't be able to make the poison.

21:15.710 --> 21:16.260
Why not?

21:16.630 --> 21:18.290
You are the Sword Wielder now.

21:18.990 --> 21:21.050
You catch attention wherever you go.

21:21.630 --> 21:22.270
Besides,

21:22.640 --> 21:24.450
you are in the middle of the trial

21:25.440 --> 21:27.790
and the Gong residence is amidst a turmoil.

21:27.790 --> 21:28.440
The clinic

21:28.690 --> 21:30.690
is under Gong Yuanzhi's authority.

21:31.420 --> 21:32.640
If you go there,

21:33.290 --> 21:33.880
it will

21:34.200 --> 21:36.870
cause unnecessary speculations and setbacks.

21:39.510 --> 21:40.980
If you trust me,

21:42.620 --> 21:43.880
I'll go on your behalf.

21:47.770 --> 21:48.190
Okay.

21:53.190 --> 21:53.650
Wait.

21:55.420 --> 21:56.220
What's wrong?

21:57.080 --> 21:58.410
I haven't finished yet.

21:59.620 --> 22:01.110
Do you know how tight

22:01.430 --> 22:03.830
the Gong residence's security is at night?

22:04.010 --> 22:05.470
Secret guards and patrols

22:05.780 --> 22:07.910
are scattered in places you can't see.

22:08.260 --> 22:10.100
The poisonous arrows and needles hidden in the shadows

22:10.100 --> 22:12.230
are indiscriminate in their attacks.

22:22.420 --> 22:23.750
This is the patrol route

22:23.840 --> 22:25.570
and layout of the secret guards

22:25.590 --> 22:26.920
from here to the clinic.

22:27.180 --> 22:28.180
Try to avoid them.

22:28.490 --> 22:30.020
Don't run into any trouble.

22:35.000 --> 22:35.800
Be careful.

22:45.250 --> 22:48.360
[Zhi]

22:59.810 --> 23:00.680
Who goes there?

23:08.720 --> 23:11.220
Yun Weishan, the Sword Wielder's new Green Jade Guardian.

23:11.220 --> 23:12.730
I was ordered to come to the clinic

23:12.730 --> 23:14.390
to make a soothing decoction.

23:15.190 --> 23:16.580
The Gong residence is on alert tonight.

23:16.580 --> 23:18.240
Return as soon as you're done.

23:19.580 --> 23:20.050
Yes.

23:31.850 --> 23:35.000
[Clinic]

23:49.900 --> 23:52.000
If the burning pain of the Fortnight Flies

23:52.000 --> 23:53.200
is too insufferable,

23:54.210 --> 23:56.620
you can use these herbs to make a tea.

23:59.170 --> 24:00.300
Add brown gardenia,

24:02.060 --> 24:03.660
sprouted fire licorice,

24:04.330 --> 24:05.860
and amber with winter worms

24:06.880 --> 24:08.490
to this prescription,

24:09.820 --> 24:11.680
Then add cinnabar and saltpeter,

24:12.840 --> 24:14.700
and boil with half-cooked water.

24:15.490 --> 24:17.240
You will create a Supreme Cold poison.

24:15.970 --> 24:22.530
[Cinnabar]

24:22.720 --> 24:25.410
[The Yang family of Gusu]

24:34.780 --> 24:38.350
[Has symptoms of dizziness, may have risks of premature birth]

24:35.260 --> 24:36.790
Has symptoms of dizziness.

24:37.300 --> 24:39.030
Thus gives birth prematurely.

24:43.620 --> 24:44.460
Nepeta.

24:48.520 --> 24:49.860
As expected of the former Sword Wielder.

24:49.860 --> 24:51.190
It's indeed deceptive.

25:00.200 --> 25:01.800
Someone is making medicine.

25:21.250 --> 25:22.380
Put down the bottle.

25:22.910 --> 25:23.570
Otherwise,

25:24.300 --> 25:25.700
the blade will come down.

25:31.900 --> 25:32.960
It's you, Miss Yun.

25:33.750 --> 25:34.660
Why are you

25:35.160 --> 25:36.690
sneaking around the clinic

25:38.060 --> 25:39.520
in the middle of the night?

25:41.420 --> 25:43.750
I'm here on the order of the Sword Wielder.

25:44.240 --> 25:45.640
How am I sneaking around?

25:46.420 --> 25:48.280
All the guards along the way saw me

25:48.540 --> 25:49.610
and guided me.

25:50.730 --> 25:52.060
If you don't believe me,

25:52.350 --> 25:54.220
you can ask them.

25:54.800 --> 25:55.180
Okay.

25:56.170 --> 25:57.430
They know you're here,

25:58.380 --> 26:00.180
but do they know why you are here?

26:00.600 --> 26:02.310
I'm here to help the Lord Sword Wielder

26:02.310 --> 26:03.880
make a soothing decoction.

26:05.430 --> 26:07.140
Those who enter the clinic without permission

26:07.140 --> 26:09.070
can be executed by the Zhi Lineage.

26:09.280 --> 26:10.280
Did you know that?

26:11.300 --> 26:13.360
Does the Sword Wielder's permission

26:13.840 --> 26:14.840
not count either?

26:30.480 --> 26:32.500
There are traces of cinnabar on your clothes.

26:32.500 --> 26:34.640
The decoction smells of saltpeter.

26:38.740 --> 26:40.070
There's also gardenia.

26:41.280 --> 26:41.870
Miss Yun,

26:43.110 --> 26:44.170
these ingredients

26:44.470 --> 26:46.570
are not soothing at all.

26:47.870 --> 26:49.130
You are making poison.

26:51.210 --> 26:52.500
The people of the Gong family

26:52.500 --> 26:55.520
all take the Herb Elixir made personally by you.

26:56.780 --> 26:58.180
What's the use of poison?

26:59.850 --> 27:01.650
Unless there's something wrong

27:04.100 --> 27:05.360
with your Herb Elixir.

27:08.820 --> 27:09.820
Give me your hand.

27:20.730 --> 27:22.390
This is a witchcraft bug.

27:22.940 --> 27:23.940
If you are honest,

27:23.970 --> 27:25.100
it will not hurt you.

27:25.820 --> 27:27.350
But if you lie,

27:28.110 --> 27:29.640
it will mercilessly stab

27:30.530 --> 27:31.830
into your skin.

27:34.390 --> 27:34.980
Tell me.

27:35.150 --> 27:36.300
Who do you plan to harm

27:36.300 --> 27:37.300
with this poison?

27:38.530 --> 27:39.140
Is it me

27:40.250 --> 27:41.050
or my brother?

27:42.770 --> 27:43.590
Or

27:45.820 --> 27:47.420
do you want to kill Gong Ziyu?

27:52.380 --> 27:53.260
It is said that Young Master Yuanzhi

27:53.260 --> 27:55.400
is a rare pharmacology genius.

27:56.350 --> 27:58.430
I didn’t expect you to be so childish.

28:03.340 --> 28:05.340
If witchcraft bugs really do exist,

28:06.090 --> 28:08.690
you should have used it to prove your innocence

28:08.950 --> 28:11.610
when Housekeeper Jia accused you the other day.

28:11.750 --> 28:13.210
You wouldn't have ended up

28:13.850 --> 28:15.980
thrown into the dungeon by the elders.

28:18.170 --> 28:20.380
Although you are not as beautiful as Shangguan Qian,

28:20.380 --> 28:21.840
you seem smarter than her.

28:22.750 --> 28:23.720
But to me,

28:24.350 --> 28:25.870
beauty and brains

28:27.440 --> 28:28.440
are both useless.

28:33.530 --> 28:34.590
Drink half of this.

28:35.610 --> 28:38.340
This is the decoction made for the Sword Wielder.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.420
I can't drink it.

28:39.420 --> 28:41.080
It's supposed to be soothing.

28:41.690 --> 28:42.950
What are you afraid of?

28:44.180 --> 28:47.380
I'm not qualified to drink the Sword Wielder's medicine.

28:47.420 --> 28:48.790
I have many herbs here.

28:48.790 --> 28:51.960
I'll help make another one for you and send it to the Yu Lineage.

28:51.960 --> 28:52.670
This clinic

28:52.710 --> 28:54.330
is under the Zhi Lineage's jurisdiction.

28:54.330 --> 28:55.780
If something from this clinic

28:55.780 --> 28:57.570
made Young Master Ziyu sick,

29:00.450 --> 29:03.050
it would be difficult for me to explain myself.

29:16.770 --> 29:17.510
Happy?

29:44.970 --> 29:47.190
Young Master Yuanzhi, what are you doing?

29:47.190 --> 29:49.020
I am the Sword Wielder's wife.

29:49.710 --> 29:51.170
The Sword Wielder's wife?

29:52.610 --> 29:54.810
I don't even respect the Sword Wielder,

29:55.110 --> 29:56.730
let alone his wife.

29:58.750 --> 29:59.810
You don't qualify.

30:01.520 --> 30:02.530
No matter who I am,

30:03.710 --> 30:05.640
how will you explain it

30:06.900 --> 30:08.900
if something happens to me in your jurisdiction?

30:08.900 --> 30:10.360
What's so hard to explain?

30:11.140 --> 30:12.380
It's a dark, moonless night

30:12.380 --> 30:13.840
with no lights or candles.

30:14.150 --> 30:15.430
I found someone

30:15.790 --> 30:17.760
stealing medicine in my clinic

30:19.650 --> 30:20.890
and killed them.

30:21.500 --> 30:23.060
Afterward, I found that the medicine thief

30:23.060 --> 30:25.260
was the Gong residence's bride-to-be.

30:25.300 --> 30:26.360
What did I do wrong?

30:28.140 --> 30:29.590
If they also find some poison

30:29.590 --> 30:30.680
on your body,

30:31.020 --> 30:32.640
people will definitely not suspect me

30:32.640 --> 30:34.770
for acting first and reporting later.

30:40.540 --> 30:41.540
It's just poison.

30:42.450 --> 30:43.560
I have plenty.

30:53.230 --> 30:54.030
Gong Yuanzhi,

30:54.610 --> 30:56.080
do you know what you are doing?

30:56.080 --> 30:56.740
Gong Ziyu,

30:57.620 --> 30:58.820
do you know what she is doing?

30:58.820 --> 30:59.870
Of course I do.

31:01.250 --> 31:03.100
Otherwise, why would I come to protect her?

31:03.100 --> 31:03.900
That's great.

31:04.260 --> 31:05.010
Tell me.

31:05.140 --> 31:05.980
How dare you, the Sword Wielder,

31:05.980 --> 31:07.540
send your unmarried wife

31:07.640 --> 31:08.860
to infiltrate the clinic in the middle of the night

31:08.860 --> 31:10.520
and secretly create a poison?

31:10.670 --> 31:11.670
Who is it for?

31:12.110 --> 31:13.370
I'm the Sword Wielder.

31:13.710 --> 31:15.640
I don't need to explain this to you.

31:40.980 --> 31:42.040
Young Master Ziyu,

31:43.550 --> 31:44.620
were you

31:45.140 --> 31:47.800
waiting for me outside the clinic all this time?

31:48.460 --> 31:49.030
Yes.

31:50.040 --> 31:51.400
I was worried about you,

31:51.420 --> 31:52.450
so I followed you.

31:54.980 --> 31:56.980
It's heavily guarded here at night.

31:57.450 --> 31:59.450
I feared you would run into trouble.

32:00.710 --> 32:02.510
Then I heard a commotion inside,

32:02.870 --> 32:04.740
so I rushed in with Jin Fan.

32:08.190 --> 32:09.090
Thank you.

32:11.740 --> 32:12.540
Young Master,

32:14.050 --> 32:15.450
I prepared the medicine,

32:15.750 --> 32:17.350
but the dosage is not enough.

32:18.090 --> 32:19.750
I'll make some more tomorrow.

32:20.210 --> 32:22.740
Is there not enough reserve in the warehouse?

32:23.300 --> 32:24.910
The Gong residence's pharmacy

32:24.910 --> 32:25.840
has everything.

32:26.320 --> 32:27.370
But just now,

32:27.790 --> 32:29.640
Young Master Yuanzhi asked me to prove

32:29.640 --> 32:31.430
that the medicine isn't poisonous,

32:31.430 --> 32:33.360
so he ordered me to drink half of it.

32:36.570 --> 32:37.570
Give me your hand.

32:41.090 --> 32:41.690
This is...

32:42.980 --> 32:43.780
Herb Elixir.

32:46.970 --> 32:48.570
Young Master, you'll give me

32:48.950 --> 32:50.170
something so precious?

32:50.170 --> 32:51.140
Rumor has it

32:51.430 --> 32:54.060
that one Herb Elixir is worth ten taels of gold,

32:55.300 --> 32:56.900
but it doesn't have a market.

32:57.060 --> 32:58.190
No one has ever

32:58.400 --> 33:00.460
bought a genuine Herb Elixir before.

33:01.070 --> 33:02.140
But for us,

33:04.060 --> 33:06.110
it's just an everyday object.

33:08.070 --> 33:09.120
If you take it now,

33:09.690 --> 33:11.750
it can remove the Supreme Cold poison

33:12.140 --> 33:13.700
you ingested for me.

33:15.090 --> 33:17.170
The Herb Elixir is the most effective

33:17.540 --> 33:18.640
when taken daily

33:19.350 --> 33:20.650
and it can protect you from the toxin

33:20.650 --> 33:21.980
before being poisoned.

33:23.030 --> 33:25.930
But if you can take it promptly after being poisoned,

33:25.930 --> 33:28.190
it can also have most of the same effects.

33:30.670 --> 33:31.330
This poison

33:31.620 --> 33:33.350
is extremely cold and painful,

33:34.290 --> 33:35.350
but it's not fatal.

33:36.160 --> 33:38.020
I'll be fine after just one night.

33:40.630 --> 33:41.790
You should keep

33:42.500 --> 33:44.230
this Herb Elixir for yourself.

33:45.020 --> 33:46.430
Don't waste

33:47.650 --> 33:49.330
something so precious on me.

33:53.260 --> 33:54.440
It's not a waste

33:55.570 --> 33:56.890
as long as it's for you.

34:11.100 --> 34:11.750
Besides,

34:12.900 --> 34:14.370
according to our arrangement,

34:14.370 --> 34:16.730
I should stop taking the Herb Elixir for a few days.

34:16.730 --> 34:17.989
Instead of wasting it,

34:18.320 --> 34:19.719
I'd rather give it to you.

34:20.570 --> 34:21.100
Alright.

34:21.690 --> 34:22.510
Stop hesitating.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.219
Take it.

34:48.280 --> 34:49.080
What's wrong?

34:50.010 --> 34:50.929
It's dark.

34:51.710 --> 34:52.570
Let me lead you.

35:08.870 --> 35:12.170
♫River lights, mountains dark, moon round♫

35:12.430 --> 35:15.510
♫Moonlight shines upon the mountain south♫

35:15.870 --> 35:17.320
♫My beloved♫

35:17.640 --> 35:21.540
♫Gazes at me but with a river between us♫

35:22.760 --> 35:26.100
♫The clouds and wind don't speak♫

35:26.350 --> 35:29.780
♫Love begins with a point in one's heart♫

35:30.220 --> 35:32.020
♫I have an empty room in my heart♫

35:32.050 --> 35:34.990
♫But it can't be filled by gold and silver♫

35:36.590 --> 35:42.890
♫A refuge in this world is rare♫

35:43.620 --> 35:50.750
♫How the years go by with whitening hair♫

35:51.080 --> 35:54.450
♫Listen to the shepherd boy's song♫

35:54.630 --> 35:57.970
♫Ask the flowers and leaves whom they fall for♫

35:58.100 --> 36:03.520
♫Wish moonlight can soothe the displaced ones♫

36:16.550 --> 36:17.350
What's wrong?

36:19.050 --> 36:21.180
I bumped into Yun Weishan in the clinic

36:21.630 --> 36:23.960
and caught her in the act of making poison.

36:24.220 --> 36:26.880
But then Gong Ziyu used his Sword Wielder status

36:27.310 --> 36:28.670
and took her away.

36:30.980 --> 36:31.740
Yun Weishan

36:32.300 --> 36:33.190
produced poison?

36:33.190 --> 36:33.940
Yes.

36:34.070 --> 36:35.470
I saw her herbal residue.

36:35.860 --> 36:39.260
It was gardenia, fire licorice, and amber with winter worms.

36:39.620 --> 36:40.730
When boiling,

36:40.750 --> 36:42.680
she added cinnabar and saltpeter.

36:43.570 --> 36:44.600
This is obviously the prescription

36:44.600 --> 36:46.000
for a Supreme Yin poison.

36:46.510 --> 36:48.770
It was turned into a lump of black residue

36:49.130 --> 36:51.930
and you could still distinguish the ingredients?

36:52.660 --> 36:53.190
Brother,

36:53.530 --> 36:54.870
others wouldn't know,

36:55.180 --> 36:56.190
but to me,

36:56.400 --> 36:57.530
it's a piece of cake.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.360
Did Gong Ziyu know

37:02.640 --> 37:04.840
that Yun Weishan was producing poison?

37:05.440 --> 37:06.470
That fool.

37:06.890 --> 37:08.750
He would say yes even if he didn't.

37:09.300 --> 37:09.830
Brother,

37:10.170 --> 37:11.110
you should've seen how he was

37:11.110 --> 37:12.620
when he protected Yun Weishan.

37:12.620 --> 37:13.380
Yun Weishan

37:13.800 --> 37:16.320
is helping Gong Ziyu pass the Ice Pool trial.

37:17.540 --> 37:18.760
Ice Pool?

37:21.130 --> 37:21.910
What is this?

37:22.160 --> 37:23.210
The Ice Lotus Pool

37:23.630 --> 37:26.360
is the first test of the Trial of the Three Realms.

37:27.060 --> 37:27.590
Brother,

37:28.740 --> 37:30.560
according to the Gong family's rules,

37:30.560 --> 37:33.020
you probably shouldn't have told me, right?

37:34.830 --> 37:37.430
You've broken more than enough rules already.

37:37.980 --> 37:38.530
Besides,

37:40.080 --> 37:41.940
I don't think I told you anything.

37:44.180 --> 37:45.310
You're so nice to me.

37:47.350 --> 37:47.880
Brother,

37:48.340 --> 37:49.660
what's so special

37:49.700 --> 37:50.760
about the Ice Pool?

37:51.150 --> 37:52.580
It sounds mysterious.

37:53.320 --> 37:54.540
Don't ask about it.

37:55.290 --> 37:56.490
When you are an adult

37:56.830 --> 37:58.890
and go to the back hill for the trials,

38:00.460 --> 38:01.990
you'll naturally find out.

38:02.180 --> 38:02.840
It's easy.

38:03.590 --> 38:05.360
I won't be a loser like Gong Ziyu

38:05.590 --> 38:07.520
and be stuck in there for 3 or 4 days.

38:08.170 --> 38:10.500
Back then, I was trapped there for 12 days.

38:31.200 --> 38:31.930
But Brother,

38:32.710 --> 38:34.290
I don't want to be the Sword Wielder.

38:34.290 --> 38:35.170
You can do it.

38:36.050 --> 38:37.570
So, I don't have to do

38:37.990 --> 38:39.520
the trials in the back hill.

38:41.370 --> 38:42.270
You must go.

38:43.680 --> 38:46.260
If you don't want to be mistreated in the future,

38:46.260 --> 38:47.000
you must go.

38:49.650 --> 38:51.050
I'll do whatever you say.

38:55.590 --> 38:56.190
By the way,

38:57.780 --> 38:59.020
Yun Weishan's prescription

38:59.020 --> 39:00.680
was very complicated.

39:01.830 --> 39:04.760
It's not something that ordinary people can master.

39:04.820 --> 39:06.710
Also, I just fought with her.

39:07.500 --> 39:09.900
Her martial arts skills aren't bad either.

39:10.780 --> 39:11.580
I don't think

39:12.690 --> 39:14.940
she is Miss Yun from Lixi Town.

39:16.010 --> 39:17.610
Of course she's not.

39:18.660 --> 39:19.610
However,

39:20.700 --> 39:22.560
there are no flaws in her identity

39:23.260 --> 39:26.060
and Gong Ziyu is protecting her with all his might.

39:26.220 --> 39:27.620
Without solid evidence,

39:28.300 --> 39:30.030
it's hard to do anything to her.

39:32.020 --> 39:32.610
However,

39:34.060 --> 39:36.120
the frost and dew are heavy in winter.

39:36.390 --> 39:37.990
If you walk too much at night,

39:38.330 --> 39:39.790
things can get dangerous.

39:56.500 --> 39:58.160
Are my hands a little cold?

39:59.780 --> 40:01.600
I've been easily cold since childhood.

40:01.600 --> 40:02.730
My body temperature

40:02.800 --> 40:04.600
is always lower than the others.

40:05.510 --> 40:06.560
But Miss Yun,

40:07.380 --> 40:08.580
your hands are so hot.

40:09.020 --> 40:10.090
I envy you.

40:11.350 --> 40:12.760
What's there to envy?

40:14.590 --> 40:15.640
The elders say

40:16.440 --> 40:18.240
the palm is the heart of the hand.

40:18.460 --> 40:19.660
Those with warm hands

40:20.260 --> 40:21.590
are also warm-hearted.

40:23.240 --> 40:25.560
Young Master Ziyu, you look cold but are warm inside.

40:25.560 --> 40:26.610
I can feel it.

40:27.300 --> 40:28.760
You're the opposite of me.

40:29.590 --> 40:30.680
On the contrary,

40:31.170 --> 40:32.550
I quite envy you.

40:34.820 --> 40:35.730
The opposite?

40:37.070 --> 40:39.670
Then, do you have a warm surface but cold heart?

40:41.040 --> 40:41.970
I can warm you up.

41:16.670 --> 41:17.970
The snow is thick.

41:18.820 --> 41:20.350
We are further into winter.

41:22.540 --> 41:23.870
Are you waiting for him?

41:28.310 --> 41:30.010
I believe he will come back.

41:43.500 --> 41:44.070
Jin Fan,

41:44.620 --> 41:45.680
where's Gong Ziyu?

41:45.900 --> 41:48.380
Lord Sword Wielder went to the back hill early in the morning.

41:48.380 --> 41:49.380
Is he okay?

41:49.380 --> 41:51.090
He has been frowning

41:51.090 --> 41:52.730
ever since he returned from the back hill.

41:52.730 --> 41:55.000
His brows are all knitted together.

41:55.560 --> 41:57.470
The Sword Wielder seems to be in good spirits.

41:57.470 --> 41:58.200
Don't worry.

41:58.500 --> 42:00.330
He seems to be confident about the Ice Pool.

42:00.330 --> 42:01.260
No wonder.

42:01.650 --> 42:03.900
I secretly heard the servants say

42:04.300 --> 42:05.600
that Miss Yun stayed in his room

42:05.600 --> 42:07.410
for half the night yesterday.

42:07.870 --> 42:09.130
It's all thanks to her.

42:11.150 --> 42:12.030
The Sword Wielder and Miss Yun

42:12.030 --> 42:13.290
merely had a chat

42:13.550 --> 42:14.320
about their aspirations

42:14.320 --> 42:15.330
and life.

42:15.350 --> 42:17.210
How do you know they were talking?

42:17.350 --> 42:18.610
You eavesdropped

42:18.920 --> 42:19.910
while doing a handstand again?

42:19.910 --> 42:21.610
I have no time to waste with you.

42:21.610 --> 42:23.210
Lord Sword Wielder gave me a task.

42:23.210 --> 42:23.780
Goodbye.

42:23.990 --> 42:24.370
Okay.

42:24.810 --> 42:25.920
I'll go with you.

42:26.930 --> 42:27.860
Take me with you.

42:28.170 --> 42:28.830
Wait for me!

42:28.840 --> 42:29.910
Hey, stop running!

42:30.100 --> 42:31.430
-Don’t follow me.
-Hey!

43:01.580 --> 43:02.270
Lady Wuji.

43:07.880 --> 43:08.680
Lady Wuji.

43:20.210 --> 43:20.990
Lady Wuji.

44:02.330 --> 44:05.130
It seems that Lady Wuji forgot to close the window.

44:30.630 --> 44:31.770
You're lucky.

44:36.750 --> 44:38.930
The Yang family of Gusu.

44:48.200 --> 44:49.880
In good health.

44:50.340 --> 44:51.770
A full-term birth.

44:55.490 --> 44:56.290
Nepeta.

44:59.520 --> 45:01.860
So this is Madam Lan's real medical case.

45:04.820 --> 45:06.080
Hide a tree in a forest,

45:06.230 --> 45:07.430
hide water in the sea.

45:09.880 --> 45:11.340
It's indeed a smart trick.

45:14.190 --> 45:15.450
Young Master Yuanzhi.

45:35.950 --> 45:37.640
How dare a mere Green Jade Guardian

45:37.640 --> 45:39.550
hurt the lord of the Zhi Lineage?

45:39.860 --> 45:40.640
How dare you!

45:40.660 --> 45:42.070
You broke into the Yu Lineage

45:42.070 --> 45:43.470
and committed thievery.

45:43.660 --> 45:45.190
As a guard of the Yu Lineage,

45:45.300 --> 45:46.960
I have the right to arrest you.

45:48.540 --> 45:49.900
You?

46:32.790 --> 46:33.590
Guardian Jin,

46:33.710 --> 46:34.640
are you alright?

46:35.500 --> 46:36.080
I'm fine.

46:36.780 --> 46:38.330
Miss Yun, please go back to your room.

46:38.330 --> 46:39.590
It's not safe outside.

46:51.380 --> 46:52.140
I knew

46:52.220 --> 46:53.350
you would come back.

46:54.150 --> 46:56.340
Young Master Xue, thank you for your leniency

46:56.340 --> 46:57.700
and giving me another chance.

46:57.700 --> 46:59.200
Agreeing to let you continue the trial

46:59.200 --> 47:01.150
was the decision of the Council of Elders.

47:01.150 --> 47:02.540
It's not us being lenient.

47:02.540 --> 47:03.600
Cut the small talk.

47:04.300 --> 47:06.530
Sword Wielder, you have already wasted many days.

47:06.530 --> 47:07.390
You must hurry.

47:20.000 --> 47:20.770
Actually,

47:21.440 --> 47:23.300
you are the true Young Master Xue,

47:25.020 --> 47:25.480
right?

47:41.420 --> 47:42.120
Father,

47:42.290 --> 47:43.210
it's too cold.

47:43.420 --> 47:44.820
I can't stand it anymore.

47:44.830 --> 47:46.050
Didn't I teach you?

47:46.470 --> 47:48.650
If you don't want to be frozen, use the chant.

47:48.650 --> 47:49.430
But...

47:49.700 --> 47:50.960
But it's so cold.

47:51.300 --> 47:52.500
I can't remember.

47:53.020 --> 47:54.010
You're so weak.

47:54.350 --> 47:56.030
You don't deserve to be my son.

47:56.800 --> 47:57.480
Gong Ziyu,

47:57.500 --> 47:58.340
come back!

47:58.550 --> 47:59.680
Where are you going?

48:08.780 --> 48:09.750
Mother!

48:11.030 --> 48:12.500
Help me!

48:14.680 --> 48:18.950
Cold air enters the clouds.

48:14.830 --> 48:33.130
[Cold air enters the clouds. The reception and delivery must be controlled. Gather in the core. Snow falls, but the heart does not.]

48:20.400 --> 48:23.320
The reception and delivery must be controlled.

48:25.100 --> 48:27.690
Gather in the core.

48:29.100 --> 48:32.370
Snow falls, but the heart does not.

48:34.520 --> 48:36.300
Don't cry. Save your strength,

48:36.760 --> 48:38.090
or else it'll be colder.

48:38.640 --> 48:40.530
He knows the Snowmelt Heart Sutra.

48:40.530 --> 48:42.930
It seems that he's a child of the Yu Lineage.

48:58.220 --> 48:59.140
Do you

48:59.520 --> 49:00.820
always stay here?

49:01.220 --> 49:01.730
Yes.

49:03.590 --> 49:05.250
Does it snow here all the time?

49:05.490 --> 49:07.150
Aren't you afraid of the cold?

49:07.460 --> 49:11.390
You know the Snowmelt Heart Sutra, but you're still afraid of the cold?

49:11.810 --> 49:15.720
Did you know that the valley outside the Gong residence has a flower market,

49:15.720 --> 49:17.120
a street market,

49:17.270 --> 49:18.470
and a lantern market?

49:18.850 --> 49:19.730
What are these?

49:20.280 --> 49:21.610
It sounds interesting.

49:21.940 --> 49:23.180
It's nothing.

49:23.510 --> 49:25.070
My mother told me before

49:25.150 --> 49:26.350
that if you leave the valley,

49:26.350 --> 49:27.710
there are seas,

49:27.820 --> 49:30.050
volcanos, and deserts.

49:30.340 --> 49:33.270
There are lots of things that I've never seen before.

49:46.030 --> 49:47.230
My father is the Sword Wielder.

49:47.230 --> 49:48.580
My brother is the Young Lord.

49:48.580 --> 49:49.910
They're all super cool.

49:49.980 --> 49:52.310
When I grow up, I'll take all you to the sea,

49:52.380 --> 49:53.330
see lanterns,

49:53.450 --> 49:55.260
and the big camels in the desert.

49:56.940 --> 49:58.280
The Gong family experienced

49:58.280 --> 49:59.820
so much turmoil in the martial arts world.

49:59.820 --> 50:01.040
Now, we live in isolation,

50:01.040 --> 50:02.650
one generation after another.

50:02.650 --> 50:04.140
What are we protecting

50:05.170 --> 50:06.900
and what are we persisting for?

50:07.260 --> 50:09.540
You'll understand when you grow up.

50:30.600 --> 50:32.600
How could a mere Green Jade Guardian

50:33.520 --> 50:34.990
be so powerful?

50:37.660 --> 50:39.460
I'll investigate Jin Fan later.

50:48.290 --> 50:48.820
Brother.

50:50.110 --> 50:52.040
I only got half of the medical case.

50:53.140 --> 50:54.670
How can we accuse Gong Ziyu?

51:20.280 --> 51:20.890
You said

51:21.400 --> 51:23.460
you have something important for me.

51:24.130 --> 51:25.350
I have an idea

51:26.460 --> 51:27.390
about what it is.

51:29.000 --> 51:29.970
I'm so nervous.

51:31.000 --> 51:33.820
But you didn't have to lock the door from the inside.

51:33.820 --> 51:35.030
I have to go out later.

51:35.830 --> 51:37.320
Tonight, you and I

51:37.370 --> 51:38.690
will be locked together.

51:38.690 --> 51:41.350
I'm going to call for help if you keep doing this.

51:45.850 --> 51:48.730
This paper looks quite old.

51:51.440 --> 51:53.610
I know why you came to me.

51:54.850 --> 51:57.200
Physicians all have messy handwriting,

51:57.830 --> 52:00.830
but you know that I'm cultured

52:00.940 --> 52:02.260
and modest.

52:02.410 --> 52:03.900
I know so, so many...

52:09.740 --> 52:10.710
Young Master Shangjue,

52:10.710 --> 52:12.120
you're hurting me.

52:13.820 --> 52:15.950
How long have you been eavesdropping?

52:17.940 --> 52:18.670
What is this?

52:19.620 --> 52:20.480
Medicinal oil.

52:21.260 --> 52:23.060
You were indeed eavesdropping.

52:24.180 --> 52:26.210
Just now, I saw Young Master Yuanzhi come back

52:26.210 --> 52:27.310
with injuries,

52:27.600 --> 52:29.910
so I wanted to bring a bottle of medicinal oil over.

52:29.910 --> 52:32.220
I didn't intend to accidentally hear...

52:36.150 --> 52:37.010
Accidentally?

52:39.790 --> 52:41.120
Young Master Shangjue,

52:41.380 --> 52:42.890
I have a way to get it back.

52:53.420 --> 52:55.080
Exactly how much did you hear?

53:00.990 --> 53:04.450
Synchronizing the spleen and liver focuses on soothing the liver,

53:04.450 --> 53:05.820
both in aura and blood.

53:05.860 --> 53:08.530
Emphasize the regulation of aura in the last trimester of pregnancy.

53:08.530 --> 53:12.410
It is best to eat less and eat light foods for nourishment.

53:12.580 --> 53:14.110
Whose medical case is this?

53:14.750 --> 53:15.590
Gusu.

53:15.670 --> 53:16.490
Gusu?

53:17.540 --> 53:19.400
Why are the words on the back torn?

53:20.670 --> 53:22.410
Who would Gong Yuanzhi

53:22.810 --> 53:23.870
care so much about?

53:24.980 --> 53:25.800
Me.

53:30.500 --> 53:31.830
It's the Sword Wielder.

53:34.920 --> 53:36.490
I have a bold guess.

53:36.890 --> 53:40.340
Is this the medical case of Gong Ziyu's mother?

53:41.810 --> 53:43.070
I also suspected that.

53:43.630 --> 53:46.430
His mother was indeed from the Yang family of Gusu.

53:46.830 --> 53:49.200
Madam Lan had a premature birth due to illness.

53:49.200 --> 53:51.410
Everyone in the Gong residence knows about this.

53:51.410 --> 53:52.710
But look, it says here

53:53.150 --> 53:54.810
that it was a full-term birth.

53:55.060 --> 53:56.720
This medical case must be full of nonsense.

53:56.720 --> 53:57.850
Where did you get it?

53:59.010 --> 53:59.920
Gong Yuanzhi

54:00.110 --> 54:02.310
stole it from Lady Wuji's room.

54:04.250 --> 54:06.700
Before Lord Sword Wielder entered the back hill for the trial,

54:06.700 --> 54:09.060
he found that Gong Shangjue and Gong Yuanzhi

54:09.060 --> 54:11.300
secretly contacted Lady Wuji several times.

54:11.300 --> 54:13.100
He asked me to keep an eye on them.

54:14.080 --> 54:15.340
Usually, they never interact

54:15.340 --> 54:17.140
with people from the Yu Lineage.

54:17.460 --> 54:19.060
There must be something wrong.

54:19.060 --> 54:20.230
They must want to

54:20.230 --> 54:22.210
cause a commotion about the Sword Wielder's birth.

54:22.210 --> 54:23.340
That's despicable.

54:24.160 --> 54:26.760
We must find the other half of the medical case.

54:26.810 --> 54:27.670
We must be fast.

54:33.700 --> 54:34.630
Can anyone help?

54:44.730 --> 54:45.530
Lady Wuji.

55:02.020 --> 55:03.180
Miss Yun Weishan,

55:03.850 --> 55:05.050
what can I do for you?

55:05.850 --> 55:07.230
I wanted to ask

55:10.030 --> 55:11.710
if you lost anything.

55:21.980 --> 55:24.110
How did you know that I lost something?

55:25.090 --> 55:26.020
Did you steal it?

55:27.400 --> 55:27.930
Speak.

55:33.730 --> 55:34.520
Anonymous.
